{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40703","headline":"寄淮海惠泽上人 · 李洞","name":"寄淮海惠泽上人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"海涛痕满旧征衣，长忆初程宿翠微。\n竹里桥鸣知马过，塔中灯露见鸿飞。\n眉毫别後应盈尺，岩木居来定几围。\n他日愿师容一榻，煎茶埽地学忘机。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李洞","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_40703.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40703","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}